{"tool_name":"background-subtractor","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>Histogram-based background subtractor for ImageJ.</p>\n\n<p>The implemented algorithm is based on the assumption that, compared to the background region, object (foreground) regions are small. The plugin builds local histograms and assumes the most occuring intensity to be part of the background.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>Histogram-based background subtractor for ImageJ.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The implemented algorithm is based on the assumption that, compared to the background region, object (foreground) regions are small. The plugin builds local histograms and assumes the most occuring intensity to be part of the background.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2019-10-17T12:31:20+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2013-10-15T10:45:49+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":4956,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6f7f584f-9218-4ec8-8781-f2eac1f45935","url":"/taxonomy/term/4956"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1505209210,"last_comment_uid":164,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Janick Cardinale"},{"value":"MOSAIC Group"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"http://mosaic.mpi-cbg.de/Downloads/BGS_manual.pdf"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":43,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"49079edf-8326-4a2f-b550-21827d985cc7","url":"/user/43"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4067,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation__R7MFwdgojfmkZ07yWbdcda0","url":"/image-correction"},{"target_id":4105,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Illumination_correction","url":"/illumination-correction